       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-KERMIT-STREAM-PROTOCOL-STRATEGY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-KERMIT-FRAME-STRUCTURE.
           05  WS-KERMIT-MARK-START        PIC X(01) VALUE X"01".
           05  WS-KERMIT-PACKET-LEN        PIC 9(02) VALUE 64.
           05  WS-KERMIT-SEQ-NUM           PIC 9(02) VALUE 00.
           05  WS-KERMIT-PACKET-TYPE       PIC X(01) VALUE "D".
           05  WS-KERMIT-CHECK-TYPE        PIC 9(01) VALUE 3.
       01  WS-KERMIT-STREAM-BOUNDS.
           05  WS-ERROR-FREE-TRANSMISSION  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-STREAM-RELIABILITY-MET   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-KERMIT-CODE        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-FRAME-KERMIT-PACKET.
           PERFORM 2000-ASSERT-STREAM-INTEGRITY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-KERMIT-STREAM.
           GOBACK.
       1000-FRAME-KERMIT-PACKET.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ERROR-FREE-TRANSMISSION.
       2000-ASSERT-STREAM-INTEGRITY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-STREAM-RELIABILITY-MET.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-KERMIT-STREAM.
           IF WS-ERROR-FREE-TRANSMISSION = 1 AND
              WS-STREAM-RELIABILITY-MET = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-KERMIT-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-KERMIT-CODE.
